Error: Jet.FixedTimingUnconfirmedTarget: This package sets `policy.harden`, and its `timing: .Fixed` values would run on `web`, where no host is confirmed to run them in fixed time.
 Why: WebAssembly leaves the machine instructions to the engine that compiles the module, and no engine states that its code takes the same time for every value; a hardened package refuses to start on an unconfirmed host, and on this target that is known when it is built.
 Fix: Build for a native target, where the program checks its host when it starts, or remove `harden: true` from the package's `policy:`.
